{title: Chaahat}
{artist: Rahat Fateh Ali Khan Jeet Ganguly}
{key: Fm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Fm] Main toh bas teri [D#] chaahat mein,        [Cm] Chahoon rehna [Fm] sada
[Fm] Main toh bas teri [D#] kurbat mein,        [Cm] Chahoon rehna [Fm] sada
[A#m] Saaya bhi [D#] tera main,        Hone na doon [G#] juda
Maine [C] tay kar [Fm] liya,        Tere [C#] ishq pe, tere waqt pe
Bas [D#] haqq hai ik [Fm] mera,        Teri [C#] rooh pe, tere jism pe
Bas [D#] haqq hai ik [Fm] mera,        Bas [A#m] haqq hai ik [Fm] mera
Bas [D#] haqq hai ik [Fm] mera,        [Fm] Main toh bas teri [D#] chaahat mein
[Cm] Chahoon rehna [Fm] sada,        [Fm] Main toh bas teri [D#] kurbat mein
[Cm] Chahoon rehna [Fm] sada,        [F] Yaadon mein tujhko rakhun
[Dm] Baatein bhi teri karoon,        [A#] Itna deewana hoon [F] tera
[F] Raaton mein jaaga karoon,        [Dm] Din bhar batakta rahoon
[A#] Main toh yahaan se bas [F] wahaan,        Tere [C#] ishq pe, tere waqt pe
Bas [D#] haqq hai ik [Fm] mera,        Teri [C#] rooh pe, tere jism pe
