[Fm] ... [D#] ... [Cm] ... [C#] ... [Fm] ... [F],        [F] Baahon mein tujhko rakhun
[Dm] Dhadkan mein teri sunoon,        [A#] Aa itna nazdeek aa [F] zara
[F] Jisme duaayein rahe,        [Dm] Har dum wafaayein rahe
